WEBVTT

00:00:00.294 --> 00:00:05.601
Fate-guiding cross.

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:09.429
Candy, doing such a thing...

00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:13.820
But I got money... now you won't have
to go to Mexico to work.

00:00:15.385 --> 00:00:19.968
Candy sold the precious rose she
got from Anthony,

00:00:20.003 --> 00:00:23.114
in order to save mr. Walther.

00:00:36.322 --> 00:00:43.533
And so, Candy continued on her journey,
accompanied by scary mr. Garcia.

00:01:27.541 --> 00:01:29.521
Dear Anthony, how are you?

00:01:29.603 --> 00:01:32.286
How are Stear and Archie?

00:01:32.574 --> 00:01:36.763
I'm writing you this letter from
halfway till Mexico.

00:01:38.385 --> 00:01:39.373
Anthony!

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:41.057
Anthony!

00:01:41.092 --> 00:01:43.960
Anthony, wait! Don't run around!

00:01:44.607 --> 00:01:47.396
Anthony, mama can't catch up to you!

00:01:50.412 --> 00:01:52.685
Mama! Mama!

00:01:53.717 --> 00:01:56.363
Candy! Candy!

00:01:59.502 --> 00:02:00.493
Candy!

00:02:04.704 --> 00:02:05.575
A dream?

00:02:07.034 --> 00:02:08.178
It's already noon.
I couldn't sleep all night.

00:02:14.126 --> 00:02:15.961
And just what kind of dream was that?

00:02:17.698 --> 00:02:19.882
Does it mean that something
could have happened to Candy?

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.592
Anthony, get up!
Anthony!

00:02:25.302 --> 00:02:26.241
It's open!

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:29.721
What, you're awake?
It's done!

00:02:30.908 --> 00:02:32.842
Look at this!
I built it during the night!

00:02:32.877 --> 00:02:34.356
It's a Candy-detector!

00:02:34.357 --> 00:02:35.695
Candy detector?

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:39.258
That's right. It'll lead
us right to where Candy is now.

00:02:39.293 --> 00:02:41.250
We'll depart as soon as possible!

00:02:41.466 --> 00:02:44.208
Great! But does it really work?

00:02:44.209 --> 00:02:48.082
Why, of course!
It follows the smell..

00:02:54.939 --> 00:02:57.481
Forgive me Anthony, I was so stupid!

00:02:57.516 --> 00:02:59.021
What's the matter?

00:02:59.995 --> 00:03:02.724
I didn't think of this before I
completed the machine...!

00:03:06.169 --> 00:03:09.020
We can't use it unless we have a
piece of Candy's clothes!

00:03:09.204 --> 00:03:12.042
But now we can't get it anymore!

00:03:13.722 --> 00:03:16.622
Brother, don't make so much noise.

00:03:16.845 --> 00:03:18.934
My head hurts like it's
going to split in half.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.903
Archie, you've been drinking?

00:03:22.645 --> 00:03:24.595
I've had a pretty bad night.

00:03:24.809 --> 00:03:26.230
Just thought about one thing.

00:03:27.782 --> 00:03:31.314
I couldn't sleep because she was
banished to such a faraway place.

00:03:31.609 --> 00:03:34.221
Who was banished to a faraway place?

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.527
Aunt!

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:42.463
You've been noisy all morning!
What's up with that?

00:03:42.498 --> 00:03:44.163
And just look at your clothes!

00:03:44.784 --> 00:03:49.009
You've become loose under Candy's
bad influence!

00:03:49.262 --> 00:03:51.960
Aunt, please borrow me that handkerchief.

00:03:52.726 --> 00:03:54.463
In return, I'll give you this.

00:03:55.398 --> 00:03:56.554
What is it?

00:04:01.142 --> 00:04:02.101
Run for it!

00:04:02.377 --> 00:04:05.955
Wait! Stear! Archie! Anthony!

00:04:10.829 --> 00:04:12.282
Now that was some noise!

00:04:12.317 --> 00:04:15.267
Now if Aunt approaches us, we will
hear the alarm!

00:04:15.302 --> 00:04:17.057
Just in the right time!

00:04:17.461 --> 00:04:19.459
It's a good solution for the Aunt issue.

00:04:20.021 --> 00:04:22.934
Candy is such a good girl.

00:04:22.969 --> 00:04:27.007
I don't even know how many memories
she kept giving us every day.

00:04:28.207 --> 00:04:29.075
Yeah.

00:04:29.233 --> 00:04:31.480
How many memories did you give us...

00:04:31.795 --> 00:04:34.449
Candy, if I knew where you are now,

00:04:34.484 --> 00:04:36.398
I'd come after you right now.

00:04:51.995 --> 00:04:53.643
Don't move!

00:04:59.876 --> 00:05:00.849
Candy...

00:05:04.928 --> 00:05:08.308
You were bitten by a rattlesnake,
but you'll be okay if I do this!

00:05:08.343 --> 00:05:09.224
Candy!

00:05:10.804 --> 00:05:12.121
Now, let's go!

00:05:36.061 --> 00:05:37.787
Alright, you wait here.

00:05:37.934 --> 00:05:40.542
There is someone I need to pick
up and take to Mexico.

00:05:40.577 --> 00:05:42.714
I have to go somewhere, too!

00:05:43.351 --> 00:05:44.329
Where?

00:05:44.364 --> 00:05:45.443
To the post office.

00:05:45.478 --> 00:05:48.448
I want to send these letters to
Pony's home and Anthony.

00:05:48.765 --> 00:05:51.302
Just when did you write these?!

00:05:51.582 --> 00:05:53.190
Give them back!

00:05:53.698 --> 00:05:55.812
You were badmouthing me in
these letters!

00:05:56.021 --> 00:05:57.078
I wasn't!

00:05:57.113 --> 00:06:00.026
You won't be able to send letters
once you arrive in Mexico!

00:06:00.818 --> 00:06:01.945
That's terrible!

00:06:03.753 --> 00:06:06.204
What is it? You're going
to get all weepy now?

00:06:06.803 --> 00:06:08.109
I won't.

00:06:08.455 --> 00:06:09.695
Who is crying?

00:06:10.395 --> 00:06:13.235
That's good. If you cried
over things like these,

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:15.572
you wouldn't be able to
continue the journey.

00:06:22.182 --> 00:06:23.589
Sheriff!

00:06:23.837 --> 00:06:26.752
That girl belongs to you, I suppose?

00:06:27.165 --> 00:06:30.046
No, I was entrusted with her
until I take her to Mexico.

00:06:30.698 --> 00:06:31.902
Is he telling the truth?

00:06:32.178 --> 00:06:34.078
Yes. Why do you ask?

00:06:34.573 --> 00:06:37.599
Lately there have been many
abductions in this area.

00:06:37.995 --> 00:06:39.179
Abductions?

00:06:39.644 --> 00:06:44.559
They kidnap children and then sell them off
to european families who want children.

00:06:44.913 --> 00:06:46.055
European...

00:06:46.243 --> 00:06:51.528
Be extremely careful. We know that
kidnappers are using an automobile.

00:06:52.315 --> 00:06:53.103
Automobile?

00:06:53.138 --> 00:06:56.677
If strangers ask you to take a ride
with them, don't even think about it!

00:06:57.412 --> 00:06:58.472
I understand.

00:06:59.283 --> 00:07:01.621
Thank you for your concern!

00:07:04.808 --> 00:07:07.447
Candy, listen up!
We'll be leaving immediately!

00:07:07.466 --> 00:07:09.039
Aren't you going to pick up someone?

00:07:10.339 --> 00:07:12.671
There are kidnappers around here
and we're not ready for them.

00:07:24.917 --> 00:07:29.488
Instead of taking her to Mexico,
I can make more money by selling Candy.

00:07:29.523 --> 00:07:32.639
In all, I'm not going to resist kidnappers
if they come after her.

00:07:33.233 --> 00:07:35.179
What would I do if I get abducted?

00:07:35.622 --> 00:07:39.038
If they take me to Europe, which is much
further away than Mexico,

00:07:39.039 --> 00:07:42.573
...I'll never see Anthony again.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:47.019
Now, how does one get discovered
by the kidnappers?

00:08:11.817 --> 00:08:13.472
Kurin, it's okay now.

00:08:13.785 --> 00:08:14.660
Let's go!

00:08:33.535 --> 00:08:34.952
Hey, it's done!

00:08:38.839 --> 00:08:40.385
Alright now, it's done!

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:47.571
You even made the bread yourself?

00:08:47.948 --> 00:08:51.076
Doug, the cook at the Leagan's
estate taught me how to make bread.

00:08:51.465 --> 00:08:55.527
Still a child, and yet she can make things
like these. I'll get pots of cash for her.

00:08:56.467 --> 00:08:57.668
Don't touch that!

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:58.577
What?

00:08:58.674 --> 00:09:01.163
You need to pray before meals!

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:04.423
What?! Pray?
I've never done that!

00:09:04.458 --> 00:09:06.340
Why don't you start from now on?

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.432
I have no need for such things!

00:09:08.754 --> 00:09:10.908
I'll take the meal then.

00:09:10.943 --> 00:09:12.984
Are you stealing that from me?!

00:09:13.396 --> 00:09:16.382
Children who didn't want to pray in
Pony's home were given little to eat!

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:19.956
What? What is that Pony's home?

00:09:20.369 --> 00:09:23.496
It's a place where children with
no parents gather.

00:09:23.629 --> 00:09:24.850
Children with no parents?

00:09:24.851 --> 00:09:29.979
A gentle sister Pony and sister Lane
were like our real mothers!

00:09:33.764 --> 00:09:37.136
We pulled pranks on each other,
but we were good friends.

00:09:37.978 --> 00:09:41.303
John, Sam, Milly...
I miss them!

00:09:43.819 --> 00:09:45.554
Put your hands like this.

00:09:46.597 --> 00:09:51.395
Our Father, who art in heaven,
hallowed be thy name, thy kingdom come.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:56.062
Lead us not into temptation,
but deliver us from evil.

00:09:56.097 --> 00:09:57.998
Give us this day our daily bread;

00:09:58.033 --> 00:10:01.248
...and forgive us our trespasses
as we forgive those who trespass against us;

00:10:01.564 --> 00:10:02.356
Amen.

00:10:06.277 --> 00:10:07.958
Huh? What is this?

00:10:08.259 --> 00:10:09.864
I'll give it to you, mr. Garcia!

00:10:10.184 --> 00:10:11.338
To me?

00:10:11.339 --> 00:10:13.148
Sister Pony gave it to me.

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.114
But why are you giving it to me?

00:10:15.296 --> 00:10:19.214
If you keep it around your neck,
you won't forget to pray.

00:10:52.645 --> 00:10:53.663
Wake up!

00:11:02.007 --> 00:11:04.772
*Denjin Anime Fansub*

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.364
Just spare my life!

00:11:27.082 --> 00:11:28.316
Anything in there?

00:11:28.838 --> 00:11:31.269
They have no money or valuable things...

00:11:32.039 --> 00:11:36.095
That's right! And it's not like we
have hidden any!

00:11:36.624 --> 00:11:38.475
So this plan backfired.

00:11:41.749 --> 00:11:45.001
Can't help it then. Let's kill
them and go back.

00:11:45.352 --> 00:11:49.096
Don't do that!
Spare my life!

00:11:49.107 --> 00:11:53.319
Why would we, when you have no money?
Give up already.

00:12:00.565 --> 00:12:05.980
Help! Help me! I'll tell you where
I have a lot of money instead!

00:12:06.015 --> 00:12:07.206
A lot of money?

00:12:09.994 --> 00:12:11.164
I'm listening!

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:15.633
Promise you'll spare my life for that!

00:12:16.103 --> 00:12:18.745
Alright. Where is the money?

00:12:19.784 --> 00:12:24.517
It's her!
Take her and you'll make a lot of money!

00:12:24.552 --> 00:12:27.120
You can sell her and earn
a lot of money!

00:12:27.526 --> 00:12:28.873
Mr. Garcia!

00:12:29.037 --> 00:12:36.791
That's right! I've heard that children
sell for quite a lot lately!

00:12:36.994 --> 00:12:39.766
Okay. We'll sell this girl then.

00:12:40.251 --> 00:12:41.002
No!

00:12:43.951 --> 00:12:45.512
Help me, mr. Garcia!

00:12:49.573 --> 00:12:52.377
Then, will you spare my life,
like you promised...

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.330
You're still here?!

00:13:00.959 --> 00:13:02.126
Mr. Garcia!

00:13:11.841 --> 00:13:13.335
Mr. Garcia!

00:13:21.719 --> 00:13:25.661
Alright, we'll find a buyer in
San Antonio tomorrow.

00:13:25.696 --> 00:13:29.548
Yeah, that's right.
I wonder how much we'll earn.

00:13:29.729 --> 00:13:32.325
Come on, that girl can't possibly
sell for much!

00:13:32.326 --> 00:13:34.847
We'd better find another job!

00:13:50.385 --> 00:13:53.019
They'll sell me to someone
tommorrow.

00:13:53.435 --> 00:13:54.628
What should I do?

00:14:05.922 --> 00:14:09.898
Damn it! I was this close
to getting killed!

00:14:10.113 --> 00:14:12.053
I've got to get out of here!

00:14:29.101 --> 00:14:31.553
I'll be okay if I already
came this far!

00:14:31.817 --> 00:14:33.731
I was saved thanks to Candy.

00:14:41.815 --> 00:14:42.935
Candy.

00:14:43.521 --> 00:14:47.605
You were bitten by a rattlesnake,
but you'll be okay if I do this!

00:14:48.196 --> 00:14:50.981
You need to pray before meals!

00:14:52.047 --> 00:14:56.504
Our Father, who art in heaven,
hallowed be thy name, thy kingdom come.

00:14:57.291 --> 00:14:58.952
I'll give it to you, mr. Garcia!

00:14:59.421 --> 00:15:03.345
If you keep it around your neck,
you won't forget to pray.

00:15:03.857 --> 00:15:05.119
Candy.

00:15:05.679 --> 00:15:07.521
Just what did I do?

00:15:08.572 --> 00:15:09.466
Candy...

00:15:10.505 --> 00:15:13.555
Candy!!!

00:15:56.824 --> 00:15:59.239
I'll set you free.
Keep quiet.

00:16:02.383 --> 00:16:04.282
Thank you, mr. Garcia!

00:16:04.317 --> 00:16:06.316
You planned this from the
very beginning, right?

00:16:06.523 --> 00:16:07.820
Well, that's... yeah.

00:16:08.161 --> 00:16:11.964
I'm sorry. I already thought that
you wouldn't come back to save me.

00:16:12.169 --> 00:16:13.648
Now, let's go, Candy.

00:16:14.054 --> 00:16:14.716
Yes.

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:36.047
We're going to run with the carriage?

00:16:36.205 --> 00:16:39.410
Yeah. It's my carriage.
You think I'd let them have it?

00:16:39.588 --> 00:16:41.009
Aren't you tired?

00:16:41.044 --> 00:16:42.957
I'll have plenty of time
for that later!

00:16:51.544 --> 00:16:52.490
Who's that!?

00:16:52.525 --> 00:16:53.644
They're running away! Fire!

00:17:07.478 --> 00:17:09.092
You released the saddles, right?

00:17:09.714 --> 00:17:12.139
That will give us a head start!

00:17:31.661 --> 00:17:32.916
I can see them!

00:18:17.718 --> 00:18:19.158
Looks like they've caught up to us!

00:18:19.193 --> 00:18:21.968
If we go into that forest,
we could make it out of this!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:27.639
Mr. Garcia, now I understand
for the first time...

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:28.986
What?

00:18:29.224 --> 00:18:33.085
What people meant when they
told me never to give up,

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:35.071
even when things are looking bad.

00:18:35.182 --> 00:18:38.207
Candy, I'll return you this!

00:18:39.773 --> 00:18:40.803
Why?

00:18:40.838 --> 00:18:43.110
I'm a cold-blooded killer!

00:18:43.913 --> 00:18:45.136
That's not true!

00:18:45.374 --> 00:18:51.084
Candy, you don't know what it means to
kill a man! Your heart is still pure!

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:54.625
But mr. Garcia, I know you worked hard
to save me back there!

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:56.931
A killer would never do something like that!

00:18:56.937 --> 00:19:01.543
Candy, this is the first time
I've done something for someone else!

00:19:11.503 --> 00:19:14.009
Candy, take this and keep going!

00:19:14.121 --> 00:19:15.087
What will you do?

00:19:15.176 --> 00:19:16.656
I'll hold them off here!

00:19:19.768 --> 00:19:20.844
Mr. Garcia!

00:19:21.136 --> 00:19:22.560
Now stop the carriage!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:31.843
Candy, run! Run for it!

00:19:37.574 --> 00:19:38.430
There they are!

00:19:46.756 --> 00:19:48.562
You did it, mr. Garcia!

00:19:53.082 --> 00:19:53.895
The kidnapper!

00:19:55.777 --> 00:19:57.536
Help me!

00:19:58.535 --> 00:20:01.019
-Candy!
-Mr. Garcia!

00:20:01.403 --> 00:20:04.039
Candy! Candy!

00:20:04.491 --> 00:20:08.047
-Mr. Garcia!
-Candy!

00:20:08.846 --> 00:20:10.709
Mr. Garcia!

00:20:11.268 --> 00:20:12.317
Candy!

00:20:13.647 --> 00:20:15.219
Candy.

00:20:17.155 --> 00:20:21.019
Because of me... because of me...
Candy...

00:20:21.665 --> 00:20:24.091
Forgive me!!!

00:20:28.634 --> 00:20:33.000
Who are you?
Where are you taking me?!

00:20:35.103 --> 00:20:37.572
Let me out!

00:20:39.137 --> 00:20:42.977
If you don't let me out,
I'll jump out myself!

00:20:48.592 --> 00:20:51.303
Kidnappers have caught me, after all.

00:20:51.812 --> 00:20:54.370
Where will I be sold off to?

00:20:55.373 --> 00:20:56.549
Anthony...

00:20:57.739 --> 00:20:59.224
Anthony!

00:21:00.382 --> 00:21:09.540
Where is Candy being taken to?
Her small chest trembled in fear.

00:21:16.689 --> 00:21:20.327
To be continued.
